- [`e_AL_effects.ex`](../lib/examples/e_AL_effects.ex) covers effect objects, aborted transactions, completion, replay, and branches.
- [`e_AL_file_watch.ex`](../lib/examples/e_AL_file_watch.ex) shows a long-lived host resource delivering events to an AL object.
